+{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01LB3hyq8KB5LwmhQk5pgYSC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EUn8Hm6rQDioHxpTq9rhUW","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/CONTRACT.md","content":"# CONTRACT — E-Commerce Backend\n\nDefinition of done. Every box must pass `npm run build`, `npm run lint`, and `npm test`.\n\n## Cross-cutting\n- [ ] All 8 factories exported from `src/index.ts` -> import compiles\n- [ ] Services never import each other; communicate only via the bus -> grep imports\n- [ ] `npm run build` compiles cleanly (Node16 ESM, `.js` extensions in relative imports)\n- [ ] `npm run lint` reports no errors\n\n## Catalog (`createCatalogService`)\n- [ ] createProduct returns a unique id and stores product -> getProduct returns the object\n- [ ] createProduct emits `product:created` with `{productId,name,price,category}` -> bus.getLog has it\n- [ ] getProduct(unknown) -> null\n- [ ] listProducts() returns all; listProducts(category) filters by category\n- [ ] searchProducts(query) matches name case-insensitively (substring)\n- [ ] updateProduct merges partial updates -> getProduct reflects new values\n- [ ] updateProduct(unknown) is a no-op (does not throw)\n- [ ] removeProduct returns true when removed, false when absent -> subsequent getProduct null\n\n## Inventory (`createInventoryService`)\n- [ ] setStock sets quantity and emits `inventory:updated` `{productId,quantity}`\n- [ ] getStock returns 0 for unknown product\n- [ ] reserve reduces stock and returns true when sufficient; emits inventory:updated\n- [ ] reserve returns false and does not change stock when insufficient\n- [ ] release increases stock and emits inventory:updated\n- [ ] setLowStockThreshold sets threshold; when stock falls below threshold a `inventory:low_stock` `{productId,currentQuantity,threshold}` is emitted (on setStock and reserve)\n- [ ] no low-stock alert emitted when no threshold configured\n\n## Cart (`createCartService`)\n- [ ] createCart returns unique id; getCart returns `{id,userId,items:[]}`\n- [ ] addItem adds item; same product added again consolidates (quantities sum)\n- [ ] addItem emits `cart:updated` `{cartId,userId,items}`\n- [ ] removeItem removes the product entirely\n- [ ] updateQuantity sets exact quantity; quantity <= 0 removes the item\n- [ ] clearCart empties items\n- [ ] getCart(unknown) -> null; operations on unknown cart are safe no-ops\n\n## Pricing (`createPricingService`)\n- [ ] calculateTotal: subtotal = sum(qty*price); tax = (subtotal-discount)*0.10; total = subtotal-discount+tax\n- [ ] discountCode applies percentage off subtotal before tax; unknown code -> discount 0\n- [ ] addDiscountCode registers a percentage code\n- [ ] getPrice returns price tracked from `product:created` events; 0 if unknown\n- [ ] monetary values rounded to 2 decimals\n\n## Orders (`createOrderService`)\n- [ ] createOrder returns id, status pending, emits `order:created` `{orderId,userId,cartId,total}`\n- [ ] getOrder returns `{id,userId,status,total}`; unknown -> null\n- [ ] updateStatus emits `order:status_changed` `{orderId,status,previousStatus}`\n- [ ] valid lifecycle: pending->confirmed->shipped->delivered; cancel allowed from pending/confirmed/shipped\n- [ ] invalid transition (e.g. delivered->shipped, or from cancelled) throws\n- [ ] listOrders(userId) returns that user's orders `{id,status,total}`\n\n## Payment (`createPaymentService(bus, options?)`)\n- [ ] processPayment resolves async; default outcome success -> `{status:success,transactionId}` and emits `payment:processed`\n- [ ] options.outcome 'failure' -> `{status:failed,error}`; 'timeout' -> `{status:timeout,error}`; both emit payment:processed\n- [ ] refund(transactionId) of a successful txn -> true (once); second refund -> false\n- [ ] refund of unknown/non-success txn -> false\n\n## Notifications (`createNotificationService`)\n- [ ] subscribe(userId) enrolls user\n- [ ] tracks order->user from `order:created`\n- [ ] on `order:status_changed` records notification for the order's user (if subscribed)\n- [ ] on `payment:processed` records notification for the order's user (if subscribed)\n- [ ] unsubscribed users get no notifications -> getNotifications returns []\n- [ ] getNotifications returns `{type,message,timestamp}` list\n\n## Analytics (`createAnalyticsService`)\n- [ ] getEventCount(type) counts events of that type observed on the bus\n- [ ] getRevenue sums order totals for orders with a successful payment\n- [ ] getConversionRate = orderCount / unique carts (0 when no carts)\n- [ ] getTopProducts(limit) ranks products by total ordered quantity, desc, limited\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":208,"cache_read_input_tokens":28486,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":208},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce5ef214-1b30-439d-84ed-f7c87efc4902","uuid":"2380b7e5-f531-4755-ab09-c8c7205cbb06","request_id":"req_011CbWGD7xPMqpEgmZV46uku"}
